# Announcement bar (top of storefront)

The dark bar at the top of `Header.tsx` is owner-curated promotional copy. Do
not add seasonal text, "Important Update" links, free-shipping callouts, or
extra promos without an explicit request.

## Required contents (current era)

1. Logo (left) — keep as-is
2. `Launch Week: 20% Off` — the only promo line allowed right now
3. `Track Order` link → `/track-order`
4. `Support` link → `/contact`

Track Order and Support must ALWAYS be present in the bar regardless of which
promo is active.

## Reference

```tsx
<div className="bg-ink-950 px-4 py-3">
  <div className="mx-auto flex max-w-7xl flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-x-4 gap-y-2 text-center text-sm leading-normal text-white/95">
    <Logo variant="dark" height="sm" />
    <span>Launch Week: 20% Off</span>
    <span className="hidden sm:inline">·</span>
    <Link to="/track-order" className="underline decoration-white/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-white">
      Track Order
    </Link>
    <Link to="/contact" className="underline decoration-white/60 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-white">
      Support
    </Link>
  </div>
</div>
```

## When the owner asks to change the promo

- Replace the `Launch Week: 20% Off` span only.
- Keep the Logo, Track Order link, and Support link untouched.
- Do not reintroduce Valentine's / BOGO / "Important Update" copy unless
  explicitly requested.
